                                internet ✗

  Tailscale lets you open each App with its own private HTTPS name from your
  phone, laptop or TV, wherever you are. Your Home network Addresses keep
  working.

  What is Tailscale?
  A service that joins your own devices into one private network, wherever
  they are. Only devices you sign in can see your Apps.

  On your phone or TV
  Install Tailscale on your phone, laptop or TV and sign in to the same

